======Simple past======
The verbs in the simple past tense are conjugated with -{{IPA|/qʼɜ/}} in the singular and <nowiki>-</nowiki>{{IPA|/qʼɜ-n(ɜ)/}} in the plural.

Examples:

* {{IPA|/qʼɜ/}} - to say → {{IPA|/ɐ-qʼɜ-qʼɜ/}} (s)he said
* {{IPA|/fɨ/}} - to eat → {{IPA|/ɐ-fɨ-qʼɜ/}} (s)he ate
* {{IPA|/tɕʼɜ/}} - to know → {{IPA|/ɐ-tɕʼɜ-qʼɜ/}} (s)he knew
* {{IPA|/kʲʼɜ/}} - to go → {{IPA|/ɐ-kʲʼɜ-qʼɜ/}} (s)he went

